          "text": "Mwumvire ababaganza, mubagamburukire: kukw ari bo bama bagavye bazigama imitima yanyu, nk’abazobibazwa; mugenze murtyo kugira ngo babikore banezerewe, batitsa umutima, kuko bimeze birtyo ata co vyomarira mwebge.",
